 "notes": "Tier shelf. Renamed Weight bar to Barbell (bar types into t); kept Kettlebell and Gymnastic rings with their old Rogue sources. Added 8 new kinds sourced from Wikipedia (Weight plate, Dumbbell, Power rack, Resistance band, Suspension trainer) and test roundups (Fitness Volt benches, BarBend cable machines, Garage Gym Reviews pull-up bars). Models are test winners from GGR barbells, Garage Gym Lab plates, Reviewed dumbbells (Bowflex SelectTech 552 kept but recalled June 2025), BarBend racks, PowerliftingTechnique kettlebells, GGR smart gyms. Life Fitness multi-gyms and Eleiko plates not added: no fetched page named the models. Rogue Fitness and Bowflex register entries are in shelf 00_00."
